Dialogue: 10,0:00:00.66,0:00:01.78,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,Five.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:01.78,0:00:02.83,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,Four.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:02.83,0:00:03.83,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,Three.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:03.83,0:00:04.90,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,Two.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:04.90,0:00:05.86,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,One.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:05.86,0:00:06.66,Default - Top,,0,0,0,,Zero.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:11.71,0:00:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Rika?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:15.26,0:00:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Rika...
Dialogue: 10,0:00:17.24,0:00:18.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Rika, it's you!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:21.82,0:00:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:23.09,0:00:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:24.34,0:00:27.03,Default,,0,0,0,,No. Rika—
Dialogue: 10,0:00:31.94,0:00:34.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll see you on the other side.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:35.30,0:00:36.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:36.43,0:00:37.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Mannen.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:38.57,0:00:41.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess this'll be goodbye for us, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:42.89,0:00:44.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Wanna keep fighting together?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:51.12,0:00:52.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Mannen!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:53.09,0:00:54.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? What?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:57.21,0:00:59.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Dot.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:59.89,0:01:03.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Dot won't kill you. Good girl.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:04.24,0:01:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Just copying Hyphen, though.{what}
Dialogue: 10,0:01:07.97,0:01:10.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Get... Get your hands off Mannen!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:13.44,0:01:16.09,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you laughing at, bitch?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:16.09,0:01:19.53,Default,,0,0,0,,When you laugh, it makes everyone happy. Frill said so.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:19.53,0:01:20.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:20.32,0:01:22.53,Default,,0,0,0,,So, Dot laughs.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:28.54,0:01:30.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you to back off!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:36.51,0:01:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:45.99,0:01:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:47.93,0:01:49.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You wet yourself.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:49.93,0:01:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,But Dot's not scary.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:52.26,0:01:53.35,Default,,0,0,0,,How funny.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:58.40,0:02:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You can eat it.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:00.34,0:02:02.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Dot doesn't like meat.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:25.80,0:02:27.39,Default,,0,0,0,,From that time...{Like that time?}
Dialogue: 10,0:04:33.43,0:04:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:41.73,0:04:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Acca? Ura-Acca?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:14.22,0:05:16.21,Default,,0,0,0,,"The temptation of death"?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:24.74,0:05:26.44,Default,,0,0,0,,"Thanatos"?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:26.77,0:05:28.47,Default,,0,0,0,,"Warriors of Eros?"
Dialogue: 10,0:05:41.62,0:05:42.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's there?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:44.04,0:05:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Ura-Acca...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:46.50,0:05:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Atmospheric room, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:57.30,0:05:59.63,Default,,0,0,0,,It's an old story.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:00.32,0:06:03.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Back before we looked like this,
Dialogue: 10,0:06:03.80,0:06:06.78,Default,,0,0,0,,we made a girl.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:06.78,0:06:07.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:09.61,0:06:10.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Just for fun.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:16.82,0:06:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Morning.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:18.53,0:06:19.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:20.53,0:06:21.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Coffee?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:21.65,0:06:23.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You make breakfast.{emphasis?}
Dialogue: 10,0:06:28.75,0:06:32.64,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,We worked at a certain research facility.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:32.64,0:06:36.34,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,We had work that no one but us could do.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:36.34,0:06:38.22,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,I think we were satisfied.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:38.22,0:06:40.85,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,But not completely.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:41.72,0:06:44.60,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,We were kept under strict surveillance.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:45.73,0:06:51.01,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,If we'd gone public or sold out to another \Ncountry, it would have been a disaster.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:51.57,0:06:54.61,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,We didn't want to do that, of course,
Dialogue: 10,0:06:54.61,0:06:56.07,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,but the stress piled up.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:56.53,0:06:57.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What shall we name her?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:57.91,0:06:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't jump the gun.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:00.24,0:07:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,How about we let her decide?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:02.12,0:07:04.04,Default,,0,0,0,,That's an idea.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:04.04,0:07:04.91,Default,,0,0,0,,And the visual?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:04.91,0:07:07.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Mmm!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:08.21,0:07:11.43,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,It was something we started just to blow off steam,
Dialogue: 10,0:07:12.30,0:07:14.63,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,but we got completely absorbed in it.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:17.68,0:07:22.13,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,We tried to picture a being \Nthat we could love like a daughter.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:22.89,0:07:25.48,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,That would make us forget that it was an AI.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:26.14,0:07:28.15,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,Unstable and complicated,
Dialogue: 10,0:07:28.15,0:07:30.76,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,like the midpoint between childhood and adulthood.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:31.40,0:07:33.15,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,We set her age as 14.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:34.01,0:07:35.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:49.68,0:07:50.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:51.30,0:07:53.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm? Is it over?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:56.93,0:07:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:57.68,0:07:58.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:15.76,0:08:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:16.86,0:08:17.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:21.51,0:08:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I am...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:26.74,0:08:28.87,Default,,0,0,0,,What is your name?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:38.97,0:08:41.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Frill.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:42.55,0:08:45.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Good. That's a lovely name.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:51.23,0:08:56.65,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,We gave her the traits that a father \Nwould want his daughter to have.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:57.28,0:08:58.11,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,Cheerfulness.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:58.65,0:08:59.95,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,Intelligence.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:59.95,0:09:01.49,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,Humor.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:01.94,0:09:04.32,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,She could call us names sometimes.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:04.32,0:09:06.33,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,She could be selfish.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:06.90,0:09:08.90,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,Flaws are important.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:08.90,0:09:11.99,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,"Being uncontrollable is the essence of femininity."
Dialogue: 10,0:09:12.53,0:09:14.33,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm just parroting Acca.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:15.17,0:09:18.08,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,Frill steadily matured.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:18.53,0:09:21.13,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,More than we imagined.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:23.78,0:09:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa! Hey!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:26.43,0:09:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:26.96,0:09:27.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:30.53,0:09:31.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:32.49,0:09:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa! What the...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:39.24,0:09:43.44,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,Under surveillance in a closed-off society,
Dialogue: 10,0:09:43.44,0:09:45.37,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,we lived like a family.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:51.28,0:09:52.67,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,More and more often,
Dialogue: 10,0:09:53.40,0:09:57.28,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,there were moments when we forgot that Frill was an AI.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:05.97,0:10:08.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, the program here is a bit...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:08.85,0:10:09.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:11.23,0:10:13.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's rest a bit, then go home.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:13.49,0:10:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Frill must be waiting.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:15.36,0:10:16.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm? Hey.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:17.68,0:10:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoops. Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:19.82,0:10:21.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, don't be.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:21.49,0:10:23.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Things are so lively, it tired me out.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:23.65,0:10:25.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:25.14,0:10:28.49,Default,,0,0,0,,A symposium on technological innovation?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:30.03,0:10:32.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought I got the venue wrong.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:33.41,0:10:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:35.19,0:10:37.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I think we'll get along.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:37.96,0:10:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Really? You read our papers?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:40.80,0:10:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes. It's an honor to meet you.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:43.84,0:10:46.57,Default,,0,0,0,,That's my kind of coincidence.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:46.57,0:10:50.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I suppose that makes our choice of location even worse.{what}
Dialogue: 10,0:10:52.02,0:10:53.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:53.06,0:10:56.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's meet somewhere quieter next time, then.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:56.47,0:10:57.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:58.36,0:11:01.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I know just the place.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:03.49,0:11:06.20,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,Her name was Hoshina Azusa.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:06.91,0:11:09.94,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,My first impression of her was, well...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:09.94,0:11:12.16,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,She seemed like a good person.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:12.54,0:11:17.32,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,But then, I doubt either of us was a good judge of women.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:19.19,0:11:22.28,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,I could tell that Acca was attracted to her.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:22.68,0:11:26.26,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,When I asked him about it, he said that so was I.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:27.28,0:11:30.68,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,Well, it was so long ago that I don't really remember.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:56.33,0:11:58.87,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,Azusa chose Acca.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:01.17,0:12:02.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll help.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:02.32,0:12:03.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:07.01,0:12:07.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Which one?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:08.26,0:12:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:09.26,0:12:10.72,Default,,0,0,0,,In cases like this,
Dialogue: 10,0:12:10.72,0:12:14.75,Default,,0,0,0,,you can tell a person's psychological \Ntendencies by who they hate.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:15.55,0:12:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Hate?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:16.94,0:12:20.34,Default,,0,0,0,,For example, do you hate your \Nhusband for cheating on you,
Dialogue: 10,0:12:20.34,0:12:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,or the other woman who you're \Nsure must have seduced him?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:27.99,0:12:30.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I bless them.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:34.37,0:12:35.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Liar.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:45.39,0:12:48.51,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,I should have picked up on it then.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:49.01,0:12:51.52,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,On what Frill wanted.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:00.64,0:13:03.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I want a friend.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:03.27,0:13:04.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:04.34,0:13:06.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Not a boyfriend?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:06.11,0:13:07.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't need one.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:08.11,0:13:10.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make another one, then.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:10.49,0:13:11.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to make her.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:12.66,0:13:16.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You two might make a girl prettier than me.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:16.85,0:13:18.07,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that about?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:24.11,0:13:25.69,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,In her own way,
Dialogue: 10,0:13:25.69,0:13:30.13,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,Frill might have been trying \Nto redirect her jealousy of Azusa.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:31.22,0:13:35.18,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,But back then, we didn't have the time to understand her.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:36.31,0:13:39.42,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,Acca was busy running the company,
Dialogue: 10,0:13:39.42,0:13:41.81,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,and I was swamped with research.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:42.60,0:13:44.36,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,And most of all,
Dialogue: 10,0:13:45.02,0:13:49.11,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,Azusa's pregnancy was special to us.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:50.18,0:13:54.49,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,"Is this how it feels to get a new niece or nephew?"
Dialogue: 10,0:13:55.31,0:13:58.66,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,That's what my head was full of when disaster struck.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:01.33,0:14:04.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Frill. What's wrong?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:05.48,0:14:07.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Is the baby a girl?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:07.65,0:14:09.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Or is it a boy?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:10.13,0:14:12.67,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like a girl on the ultrasound.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:14.47,0:14:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,A girl?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:15.68,0:14:17.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:17.55,0:14:19.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you be a good big sister?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:24.44,0:14:26.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think I can.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:26.27,0:14:26.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:40.66,0:14:42.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Ow! It hurts!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:42.62,0:14:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:43.50,0:14:44.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:48.88,0:14:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It hurts...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:58.75,0:15:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It "hurts"?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:02.83,0:15:05.23,Default,,0,0,0,,All you're doing is detecting inputs.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:08.09,0:15:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:09.80,0:15:11.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Not the dark!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:11.88,0:15:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Not the scary place!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:18.39,0:15:22.04,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,There was nothing I could say or do
Dialogue: 10,0:15:22.04,0:15:24.33,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,as a few more years passed.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:25.40,0:15:28.38,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,What saved Acca and me from that...
Dialogue: 10,0:15:32.38,0:15:36.76,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,was Himari, the daughter Azusa left behind.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:37.93,0:15:42.54,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,Himari's presence saved us more than I can say.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:43.31,0:15:45.56,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,She was smart like Acca
Dialogue: 10,0:15:45.56,0:15:47.85,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,and had a sense of humor like Azusa.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:48.50,0:15:50.76,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,Her carefree cheerfulness
Dialogue: 10,0:15:50.76,0:15:54.90,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,seemed like it would bring us back \Nfrom our lowest point to how we used to be.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:01.18,0:16:06.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Uncle, is it true you and my dad fought over my mom?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:06.15,0:16:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Who'd you hear that from?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:08.82,0:16:09.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, tell me.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:10.57,0:16:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess so.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:12.71,0:16:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I got shot down and lost to your dad in no time.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:16.38,0:16:18.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Were you sad? Was it hard?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:19.43,0:16:20.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this about?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:20.64,0:16:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, you had to see them happy \Ntogether in front of you the whole time.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:26.04,0:16:27.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:27.29,0:16:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for sympathizing with your luckless uncle.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:31.21,0:16:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you wait?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:32.52,0:16:33.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:34.32,0:16:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Until I grow up.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:37.74,0:16:39.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? What are you—
Dialogue: 10,0:16:39.57,0:16:41.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I look like my mom, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:42.27,0:16:43.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll get more like her.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:44.83,0:16:46.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:46.83,0:16:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,If you wait, I wouldn't mind marrying you.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:51.82,0:16:54.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't try to act grown-up, kid.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:56.88,0:16:59.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not a kid! I'm in junior high!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:08.56,0:17:11.51,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,That night, Himari died.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:12.77,0:17:16.90,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,It looked like suicide, but there was no note.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:17.43,0:17:19.55,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,And what caused it?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:19.55,0:17:20.82,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,Bullying at school?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:20.82,0:17:22.49,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,Relationships with friends?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:22.49,0:17:24.16,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,Problems at home?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:24.73,0:17:28.66,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,Acca had shown her love in his own way.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:28.66,0:17:31.42,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,So, a sudden impulse?{ugh}
Dialogue: 10,0:17:31.86,0:17:34.17,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,She wasn't like that. She wasn't.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:48.96,0:17:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is this?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:12.86,0:18:14.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It was you?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:14.17,0:18:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You killed Himari?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:16.75,0:18:18.17,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:18.17,0:18:20.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't give me a kiss after so long?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:21.55,0:18:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Answer me.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:23.12,0:18:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You did it, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:24.89,0:18:26.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You did something.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:26.64,0:18:28.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You used Hyphen and Dot.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:28.97,0:18:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You sound awfully certain.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:31.73,0:18:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be anything else.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:33.84,0:18:35.09,Default,,0,0,0,,But you...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:35.09,0:18:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You must have been able to do it somehow.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:37.84,0:18:39.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you praising me?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:39.61,0:18:41.40,Default,,0,0,0,,"You're such a good girl, Frill"?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:41.40,0:18:43.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut the crap!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:43.15,0:18:45.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You monster!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:50.48,0:18:52.75,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you so upset about?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:52.75,0:18:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not like she was {\i1}your{\i0} daughter.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:55.00,0:18:56.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up, monster!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:57.33,0:19:00.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not a monster. I'm Frill.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:01.38,0:19:04.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, I want to get out of here.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:04.47,0:19:05.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you want to know?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:06.08,0:19:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,About that girl?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:08.97,0:19:13.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you want to know how that girl, \Nwho loved her "uncle" so much, died?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:14.92,0:19:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Frill!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:19.13,0:19:22.05,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,I completely lost it.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:22.59,0:19:24.34,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,I was as angry as Acca.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:24.34,0:19:27.82,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,Actually, I might have hated her even more.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:28.81,0:19:30.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you going to kill me?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:30.89,0:19:32.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not human.{a human?}
Dialogue: 10,0:19:32.77,0:19:34.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I am human.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:34.37,0:19:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm scared of the dark, and I get toothaches.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:38.50,0:19:39.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up, monster.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:40.29,0:19:44.01,Default,,0,0,0,,My. Name. Is. Frill.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:45.47,0:19:47.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't pretend not to see me.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:48.26,0:19:50.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I was born from the two of you.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:02.52,0:20:04.78,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,We started investigating.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:05.07,0:20:09.45,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,We gathered and analyzed data \Non girls' suicides in that age range.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:09.45,0:20:10.45,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,There were many causes.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:11.52,0:20:14.65,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,But we wondered if there could also be another push
Dialogue: 10,0:20:14.65,0:20:16.54,Default - Brain,,0,0,0,,that drove them to suicide.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:19.73,0:20:21.67,Default,,0,0,0,,The temptation of death?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:21.67,0:20:23.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Unless it's stopped,
Dialogue: 10,0:20:23.26,0:20:26.30,Default,,0,0,0,,girls will end up dying when they don't have to.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:27.22,0:20:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,All because of our mistake.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:30.30,0:20:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,So, we made the Wonder Eggs
Dialogue: 10,0:20:32.48,0:20:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,and looked for a way to interfere with their plans.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:39.46,0:20:41.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What did she think?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:42.34,0:20:43.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Not a clue.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:43.67,0:20:47.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What made you want to at least tell Ai?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:47.32,0:20:48.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know that either.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:50.11,0:20:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,But closing her heart out of fear,
Dialogue: 10,0:20:53.73,0:20:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,or building walls out of hatred
Dialogue: 10,0:20:56.27,0:20:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,would just make her easy prey for Frill.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:59.62,0:21:02.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean she'd repeat our mistakes?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:13.18,0:21:14.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:47.52,0:22:48.59,Default,,0,0,0,,To be continued.
